  "cited_article_id": "create-online-intake-forms",
  "reply": "1. Open **Patient Portal > Form Builder** and click **New Form**; choose a template (e.g., Medical History). 2. Drag‑drop the needed fields and enable **Mandatory** for required items. 3. Click **Save Draft**, then **Publish to Portal**. 4. Assign the form to appointment types under **Patient Portal > Settings**.\n\nIf you get validation errors when publishing or patients submit the form: check for duplicate field IDs or dropdowns without assigned options, correct any flagged items, then clear your browser cache and reload **Form Builder**. If errors continue after these fixes, contact support."
}
